tags: $:/tags/Global
title: $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/modules/widgets/hgsd-pick-append

\whitespace trim

<!-- One-row list adder over $hgsd.pick — the pick family's list member, sibling of $hgsd.pick-field (the three-state single-value editor). direction carries the same bit and vocabulary the prereq row procedure uses: "own" appends the picked title to target's field (the DependsOn panel), "item" appends target's title to the PICKED tiddler's field (PrereqOf — the mirror side, where "adding" means the other action gains the prerequisite). The keyboard commit (the $keyboard binding, Enter by default) routes through hgsd-pick-keyboard-commit (in hgsd-pick.tid): the create-vs-append fork — including the pick's existence check — evaluates ONLY at keypress inside the keyboard's actions string, so panel renders pay nothing (the 2026-09-27 reason the fork is never precomputed at render; the instant-commit dispatcher already ran this way). The button row declares its affordances in order through one elseif chain on the same create gate (a non-blank pick that names no tiddler shows the create-and-add button — via hgsd-new-options, the kind-mapped wrapper — in the commit slot; an existing pick shows Add; a blank box shows only hgsd-new-fallback's plain new button): one commit affordance per pick state. hgsd-new-options receives the same bit as its kind (create-fork shape). add-temp is deterministic per id plus write target (qualify() would collide two simultaneously open tiddlers) and lives under the prefix the view-body refresh guard whitelists. tooltip/caption override the new-button fallback's generic strings (blank = generic); new-project/new-complete pass through to the created action. -->
\widget $hgsd.pick-append(field, tiddler:"", id, list-filter, direction:"own", group-by:"", none-title:"", search-mode:"extended", new-type:"", new-status:"next", new-update-status:"no", new-project:"", new-complete:"false", tooltip:"", caption:"")
<$let target={{{ [<tiddler>!match[]then<tiddler>else<currentTiddler>] }}}>
<$let add-temp={{{ [[$:/temp/hypergsd/add-]addsuffix<id>addsuffix[-]addsuffix<target>] }}}>
<div class="gsd-list-item hgsd-sizer-droplist">
    <div>
    <$keyboard key="enter" actions="""<$transclude $variable="hgsd-pick-keyboard-commit"/>""">
    <$hgsd.pick
        tiddler=<<add-temp>>
        list-filter=<<list-filter>>
        group-by=<<group-by>>
        none-title=<<none-title>>
        search-mode=<<search-mode>>
        id=<<id>>
        commit-kind={{{ [<direction>match[item]then[append-to-picked]else[append]] }}}
        commit-tiddler=<<target>>
        commit-field=<<field>>
        commit-value=<<target>>/>
    </$keyboard>
    </div>
    <div>
    <%if [<add-temp>get[hgsd-pick]!match[]] :filter[<new-type>!match[]] :and[!is[tiddler]] %>
        <$transclude $variable="hgsd-new-options" kind=<<direction>>/>
    <%elseif [<add-temp>get[hgsd-pick]!match[]] %>
    <%if [<direction>match[item]] %>
    <$button>
        <$action-listops $tiddler={{{ [<add-temp>get[hgsd-pick]] }}} $field=<<field>> $subfilter="[<currentTiddler>]" />
        <$action-setfield $tiddler=<<add-temp>> hgsd-pick=""/>
        {{$:/language/EditTemplate/Fields/Add/Button}}
    </$button>
    <%else%>
    <$button>
        <$action-listops $tiddler=<<target>> $field=<<field>> $subfilter="[<add-temp>get[hgsd-pick]]" />
        <$action-setfield $tiddler=<<add-temp>> hgsd-pick=""/>
        {{$:/language/EditTemplate/Fields/Add/Button}}
    </$button>
    <%endif%>
    <%endif%>
    <$transclude $variable="hgsd-new-fallback"/>
    </div>
</div>
</$let>
</$let>
\end